# Unity generated folders
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/

# Asset metadata should be committed
!/[Aa]ssets/**/*.meta
!/[Pp]ackages/**/*.meta
!/[Pp]roject[Ss]ettings/**/*.meta

# IDE and editor files
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db

# Unity generated solutions and project files
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]cripts/**/*.csproj
/[Aa]ssets/[Ee]ditor/**/*.csproj
/[Aa]ssets/[Pp]lugins/Editor/**/*.csproj

# Crash reports and diagnostics
sysinfo.txt
*.stackdump

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Auto-generated addressables data
[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/*/*.bin*

# Visual Studio cache
.vsconfig

# Build artifacts
/[Rr]elease/
/[Dd]ebug/
/[Aa]rtifacts/
